WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.030
India has initiatives to control STIs and RTIs.

2
00:00:06.030 --> 00:00:11.030
STI control is crucial for public health.

3
00:00:11.030 --> 00:00:17.040
Antara, Chhaya, and Sathi Clinics are not the primary brands.

4
00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:22.040
Suraksha Clinic is the correct brand.

5
00:00:22.040 --> 00:00:27.260
Suraksha Clinics provide essential STI services.

6
00:00:27.260 --> 00:00:32.260
Remember Suraksha as Safety in Hindi.

7
00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:37.360
Focus on key terms like STI and Suraksha.

8
00:00:37.360 --> 00:00:42.980
Refer to National AIDS Control Organisation guidelines.

9
00:00:42.980 --> 00:00:48.000
Suraksha Clinics are crucial for STI control.
